From 0953b2b88fc78ef3334194cc0bd1bb1a1f46e9ac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Work Leaf Bench <bench@example.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 06:24:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] UPDATE slash command routing so selected agents receive
 prompt commands

Slash-prefixed command input now follows the selected-agent path when a session is selected, while the command surface still rejects slash commands without a selected agent. The controller tracks selected sessions so terminal prompt-mode and chat-mode routing agree, and the tests cover fake-backend and spawned Codex-style raw slash sends.
